s nosotros mismos: si la medida no está en stock, la tendremos lista en 14 días. Nos pondremos en contacto contigo directamente para concretar el día y la hora del transporte y la instalación.\n\nLas imágenes son renders: el tono y el dibujo de las vetas pueden variar ligeramente entre piezas.	A Dekton washbasin, or bathroom sink, with clean, straight lines and a sloped bowl, with a drain and a tap hole. Reverie is a bright white with long, thin veins in golden and copper tones, with a marble-like look.\n\nDekton is an ultracompact surface by Cosentino with very low porosity. It resists scratches, stains and heat, and cleans with just water and soap.\n\nIt comes in five widths (40, 60, 80, 100 and 120 cm), always 48 cm deep, and the sizes are compatible with IKEA ÄNGSJÖN bathroom units. Order it without a unit, to hang on the wall or to place on a unit you already own, or with a custom-made bathroom unit.\n\nIt includes the tap hole, the drain and the mounting brackets. We make it ourselves: if your size is not in stock, we will have it ready in 14 days. We will contact you directly to arrange the day and time for transport and installation.\n\nThe images are renders: tone and the pattern of the veining may vary slightly from piece to piece.	Aplom	843.80	\N	21.00	1021.00	EUR	20	NEW	ACTIVE	[]	0	0	2026-10-02 16:14:05.97	2026-10-02 16:35:07.896	120	120	100000	46	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-10-02 16:35:07.896	f	unit	1.000	0	f	f	\N	\N	\N	null	\N	Aplom, SL	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	t	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N	\N	f	t	\N	\N	\N	200	t	0	f
