tradición, territorio y futuro.\n\nDesde los olivos centenarios de Fulla de Salze hasta las nuevas plantaciones de Arbosana, pasando por la delicadeza de la Arbequina y el equilibrio de nuestro Coupage, os invitamos a descubrir la riqueza y diversidad de los aceites de nuestra tierra.\n\nCuatro perfiles. Cuatro historias. Un mismo origen.	**OUR EXTRA VIRGIN OLIVE OILS**\n\n*Four oils, four ways to discover our land.*\n\nOur range of extra virgin olive oils includes a balanced and versatile Coupage, together with three single-variety oils that showcase the distinctive character of each olive variety: Arbequina, smooth, fruity and elegant; Fulla de Salze, an indigenous variety from our area, produced from our centuries-old olive trees and known for its particularly sweet, smooth and delicate oil; and Arbosana, produced from our newest olive plantations, with a greener, more vegetal profile and a little more character.\n\nEach oil expresses a different part of the way we understand olive growing: tradition, land and the future.\n\nFrom the centuries-old Fulla de Salze olive trees to the newest Arbosana plantations, through the delicacy of Arbequina and the balance of our Coupage, we invite you to discover the richness and diversity of the olive oils from our land.\n\nFour profiles. Four stories. One shared origin.	La Ginesta 0,25 litres	4.33	\N	4.00	4.50	EUR	0	NEW	ACTIVE	[]	0	0	2026-09-07 09:28:23.604	2026-09-07 20:57:56.744	24	5	250	5	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-09-07 20:57:56.743	t	l	0.250	0	t	f	\N	\N	\N	{"storageEs": "", "allergensEs": "", "businessName": "", "ingredientsEs": "Olives"}	\N	AGRICOLA I SECCIO DE CREDIT LA GINESTA SCCL	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N	\N	f	t	\N	\N	\N	200	t	0	f
