útalo\n\n**Contraindicaciones:** sin contraindicaciones conocidas.\n\n**Compromiso**\n- Cultivo ecológico\n- Producción sostenible\n- Comercio de proximidad\n- Packaging sostenible	**Organic thyme**, a herb with an intense, herbal aroma, essential in Mediterranean cooking and with a long tradition as a winter infusion. *Caffeine-free.*\n\n**Format:** 60 g tin of organically grown dried leaf.\n\n**Properties**\n- Natural antiseptic, traditionally used to accompany colds and help clear mucus\n- Traditionally used to care for the throat and airways\n- Digestive, ideal after meals\n\n**Uses**\n- As a hot infusion, on its own or with honey and lemon\n- To make traditional Catalan thyme soup\n- In the kitchen, to flavour meat, stews, vegetables and marinades\n\n**How to prepare it**\n- Heat water to 95 °C\n- Steep for 5 minutes with the lid on to keep the aromas in\n- Strain and enjoy\n\n**Contraindications:** no known contraindications.\n\n**Our commitment**\n- Organic farming\n- Sustainable production\n- Local trade\n- Sustainable packaging	Aromik	6.27	\N	10.00	6.90	EUR	0	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Sense Teïna", "keyEn": "Caffeine-Free", "keyEs": "Sin Teína", "valueCa": "Sí", "valueEn": "Yes", "valueEs": "Sí"}, {"keyCa": "Ecològica", "keyEn": "Organic", "keyEs": "Ecológica", "valueCa": "Sí", "valueEn": "Yes", "valueEs": "Sí"}]	0	0	2026-09-13 13:34:14.266	2026-09-13 13:37:10.729	11	10	70	10	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-09-13 13:37:10.72	t	g	60.000	0	f	f	\N	\N	\N	{"storageEs": "Conservar en un lloc fresc i sec.", "allergensEs": "", "businessName": "", "ingredientsEs": "Thymus vulgaris."}	Cami pla de la torreta 1 bis	Planteles lloveres SL	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	t	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N	\N	f	t	\N	\N	\N	200	t	0	f
