ot's format for discovering our scents before choosing your favourites.** A small cube of scented wax that melts in a wax melt burner, so you can experience the fragrance at home.\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Himalayan salt · Wild sage**\n\nHimalayan salt brings a mineral, clean feeling, while wild sage adds a green, herbal and aromatic character.	Talabot Studio	1.65	\N	21.00	2.00	EUR	0	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Mineral, herbal i fresc", "valueEn": "Mineral, herbal and fresh", "valueEs": "Mineral, herbal y fresco"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Sal de l'Himàlaia · Sàlvia silvestre", "valueEn": "Himalayan salt · Wild sage", "valueEs": "Sal del Himalaya · Salvia silvestre"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "1 Discovery Cube", "valueEn": "1 discovery cube", "valueEs": "1 Discovery Cube"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "10 g aprox.", "valueEn": "10 g approx.", "valueEs": "10 g aprox."}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "3 × 3 × 1,5 cm", "valueEn": "3 × 3 × 1.5 cm", "valueEs": "3 × 3 × 1,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Ús", "keyEn": "Use", "keyEs": "Uso", "valueCa": "Per a cremadors de wax melts", "valueEn": "Wax melt burner", "valueEs": "Quemador para wax melts"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Fet a mà en petits lots a Barcelona", "valueEn": "Hand-poured in small batches in Barcelona", "valueEs": "Vertido a mano en pequeños lotes en Barcelona"}]	0	0	2026-10-19 00:09:12.015	2026-10-18 22:10:37.616	4	5	20	5	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-10-18 22:10:37.595	t	\N	\N	0	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	Carrer de València 190, 08011 Barcelona, España · info@talabotstudio.com	Talab