ace it in your wax burner and get ready to fill your space with a sweet and comforting aroma. 🍒🤎\n\nScent\n\n🍒 Sweet, juicy and fruity cherry, accompanied by a delicious gourmand character.\n\nAn enveloping and indulgent fragrance, perfect for those who love fruity scents but are looking for something more special than a simple fruit fragrance.	Moods Candles	7.02	\N	21.00	8.50	EUR	9	NEW	ACTIVE	[]	0	0	2026-10-04 09:03:43.24	2026-10-05 05:41:13.59	10	10	80	10	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-10-05 05:41:13.58	f	unit	1.000	0	f	f	\N	Edgar saperas	Edgar saperas	null	Carrer de Cèsar Martinell i Brunet	Moodscandles	Cómo usarlo\n\nColoca un wax melt en la parte superior de tu quemador.\n\nIntroduce una velita de té en la base.\n\nDisfruta de cómo el aroma se libera poco a poco y llena tu hogar.\n\nCuando el wax melt deje de desprender fragancia, deja que la cera se enfríe antes de retirarla para cambiarla por otro aroma.	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	t	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N	\N	f	t	\N	\N	\N	200	t	0	f
