ling of freshly washed, aired fabrics, with a clean, fresh, bright and **highly intense** scent.\n\nSoap combines with linen and the softness of cotton flower to create an airy yet intense fragrance that leaves your drawers with a fresh, long-lasting sense of cleanliness.\n\n**The box contains 9 scented cubes of 3 × 3 × 2 cm** and organza bags, so you can spread them across different drawers and adjust the intensity of the scent.\n\nThis scent is also available as a **Wax Melt** and **Discovery Cube.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Soap · Linen · Cotton flower**\n\nA clean soap accord opens the fragrance, joined by the fresh, airy character of linen and the softness of cotton flower. A **clean**, bright scent whose intensity lingers in the space.	Talabot Studio	9.92	\N	21.00	12.00	EUR	3	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Net, airejat i intens", "valueEn": "Clean, airy and intense", "valueEs": "Limpio, aireado e intenso"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Sabó · Lli · Flor de cotó", "valueEn": "Soap · Linen · Cotton flower", "valueEs": "Jabón · Lino · Flor de algodón"}, {"keyCa": "Pes total", "keyEn": "Total weight", "keyEs": "Peso total", "valueCa": "140 g", "valueEn": "140 g", "valueEs": "140 g"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "9 daus aromàtics", "valueEn": "9 scented cubes", "valueEs": "9 cubos aromáticos"}, {"keyCa": "Mides de la caixa", "keyEn": "Box dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas de la caja", "valueCa": "10,5 × 10,5 × 3,5 cm", "valueEn": "10.5 × 10.5 × 3.5 cm", "valueEs": "10,5 × 10,5 × 3,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Mides de cada dau", "keyEn": "Size of each cube", "keyEs": "Medidas de cada cubo", "valueCa": "3 × 3 × 2 cm", "valueEn": "3 × 3 × 2 cm", "valueEs": "3 × 3 × 2 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Vegetal de soja i coco", "valueEn": "Plant-based soy and