 Mecha de algodón\n- Esencias naturales\n- Envase reutilizable\n\nModo de uso: Enciende la vela en una superficie estable y deja que la primera combustión funda toda la capa superior de cera para evitar túneles.\nRecorta ligeramente la mecha antes de cada uso para mantener una llama estable y prolongar la duración de la vela.	Warm, soft, and woody aroma. Sandalwood has a creamy and enveloping character, with delicately sweet notes that convey calm and comfort. It is a balanced and elegant scent, ideal for creating a cozy and relaxing atmosphere at home.\n\nHandcrafted in our workshop with 100% natural soy wax, a cotton wick, and natural essences, it offers a clean and smooth burn without dense smoke or unnecessary substances. Its warm light transforms any room into a tranquil and comfortable setting.\n\nThe metal tin with a lid is practical and reusable, designed to store the candle or give it a second life once finished.\n\nCharacteristics:\n\n- 200g of 100% natural soy wax\n\n- Approximate burning time: 35–40 hours\n\n- Handcrafted\n\n- Cotton wick\n\n- Reusable container\n\nHow to use: Light the candle on a stable surface and let the first burn melt the entire top layer of wax to prevent tunneling.\nTrim the wick slightly before each use to maintain a steady flame and prolong the life of the candle.	DIDO COSMÈTICA NATURAL	12.40	\N	21.00	15.00	EUR	0	NEW	ACTIVE	[]	0	0	2026-10-05 18:42:58.623	2026-10-05 20:03:17.404	7	24	380	12	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-10-05 20:03:17.395	t	g	200.000	0	t	f	\N	\N	\N	null	C/Ermita 2, Montferri (Tarragona)	DIDO COSMÈTICA NATURAL	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	t	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N	\N	f	t	\N	\N	\N	200	t	0	f
