 released slowly. Made with plant-based wax and finished with **botanical details**, every piece is slightly different.\n\nThis scent is also available as a **candle**, **Wax Melt**, **100 ml Home Spray**, **Tin Pack** and **Discovery Cube.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Amber · Tonka · Warm woods**\n\n**Amber** brings warmth and depth, **tonka** adds a soft, enveloping nuance, while **warm woods** create an elegant, comforting woody base.	Talabot Studio	6.20	\N	21.00	7.50	EUR	3	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Càlid, afustat i elegant", "valueEn": "Warm, woody and enveloping", "valueEs": "Cálido, amaderado y envolvente"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Ambre · Tonka · Fustes càlides", "valueEn": "Amber · Tonka · Warm woods", "valueEs": "Ámbar · Tonka · Maderas cálidas"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Vegetal de soja i coco", "valueEn": "Plant-based soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Vegetal de soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "70 g", "valueEn": "70g", "valueEs": "70g"}, {"keyCa": "Format", "keyEn": "Format", "keyEs": "Formato", "valueCa": "Ambientador sòlid penjant", "valueEn": "Hanging solid air freshener", "valueEs": "Ambientador sólido colgante"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "5 × 9,5 cm", "valueEn": "5 × 9.5 cm", "valueEs": "5 × 9,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Color", "keyEn": "Colour", "keyEs": "Color", "valueCa": "Blanc amb elements naturals i botànics", "valueEn": "White with natural, botanical elements", "valueEs": "Blanco con elementos naturales y botánicos"}, {"keyCa": "Presentació", "keyEn": "Packaging", "keyEs": "Presentación", "valueCa": "Inclou bossa d'organza protectora", "valueEn": "Includes a protective organza bag", "valueEs": "Incluye bolsa de organza protectora"}, {"keyCa": "Ús", "keyEn": "Use", "keyEs": "U