 gift as a small scented extra.**\n\nA small format made to try the fragrance at home and see how it fits your space.\n\n**The Lobby recreates the atmosphere of the entrance of a grand hotel: warm, elegant and enveloping.** Amber, tonka and warm woods create a sophisticated composition with depth and a comforting woody base.\n\nUse the Discovery Cube in a wax melt burner to experience the fragrance before choosing it in other formats.\n\n**Contents: approx. 10 g**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Amber · Tonka · Warm woods**\n\nAmber brings warmth and depth, tonka adds a soft, enveloping nuance, while warm woods create an elegant, comforting woody base.	Talabot Studio	1.65	\N	21.00	2.00	EUR	0	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Càlid, afustat i elegant", "valueEn": "Warm, woody and enveloping", "valueEs": "Cálido, amaderado y envolvente"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Ambre · Tonka · Fustes càlides", "valueEn": "Amber · Tonka · Warm woods", "valueEs": "Ámbar · Tonka · Maderas cálidas"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "1 Discovery Cube", "valueEn": "1 discovery cube", "valueEs": "1 Discovery Cube"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "10 g aprox.", "valueEn": "10 g approx.", "valueEs": "10 g aprox."}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "3 × 3 × 1,5 cm", "valueEn": "3 × 3 × 1.5 cm", "valueEs": "3 × 3 × 1,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Ús", "keyEn": "Use", "keyEs": "Uso", "valueCa": "Per a cremadors de wax melts", "valueEn": "For wax melt burners", "valueEs": "Para quemador de wax melts"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Fet a mà en petits lots a Barcelona", "valueEn