e higuera aporta un carácter **verde y vegetal**, mientras el higo añade una faceta suave y ligeramente afrutada. El fondo de madera aporta profundidad y equilibra la composición. Una fragancia **fresca, mediterránea y envolvente**.	**Discover Bajo la Higuera before choosing your favourite format, or add it to a personalised gift as a small scented extra.**\n\nA small format made to try the fragrance at home and see how it fits your space.\n\nBajo la Higuera evokes the cool shade of a fig tree in summer. A **green, fresh and slightly fruity** fragrance, where fig leaf brings its leafy character and fig pulp adds a natural, creamy softness. A Mediterranean, serene and enveloping scent.\n\nUse the Discovery Cube in a wax melt burner to experience the fragrance before choosing it in other formats.\n\n**Contents: approx. 10 g**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Fig leaf · Fig · Wood**\n\nFig leaf brings a **green, leafy** character, while fig adds a soft, slightly fruity facet. The wood base adds depth and balances the composition. A **fresh, Mediterranean and enveloping** fragrance.	Talabot Studio	1.65	\N	21.00	2.00	EUR	0	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Càlid, afruitat i mediterrani", "valueEn": "Warm, fruity and Mediterranean", "valueEs": "Cálido, afrutado y mediterráneo"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Fulla de figuera · Figa · Fusta", "valueEn": "Fig leaf · Fig · Wood", "valueEs": "Hoja de higuera · Higo · Madera"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "1 Discovery Cube", "valueEn": "1 discovery cube", "valueEs": "1 Discovery Cube"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "10 g aprox.", "valueEn": "10 g approx.", "valueEs": "10 g aprox."}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "3 × 3 × 1,5 cm", "valueEn": "3 × 3 × 1.5 cm", "valueEs": "3 ×