lanco · Muguet · Musk**\n\nUna mezcla de flores donde el **geranio y el clavel** aportan carácter, acompañados por la delicadeza de la flor de té blanco y el muguet. El musk suaviza el conjunto y aporta un fondo limpio y confortable. Una composición **floral, fresca y delicada**, que recuerda a un jardín lleno de flores.	**Discover El Jardín de la Abuela before choosing your favourite format, or add it to a personalised gift as a small scented extra.**\n\nA small format made to try the fragrance at home and see how it fits your space.\n\n**El Jardín de la Abuela** evokes a garden full of flowers and memories. A **floral**, fresh and delicate fragrance, where **geranium** and carnation intertwine with the delicacy of **white tea flower and lily of the valley**, over a soft musk base.\n\nUse the Discovery Cube in a wax melt burner to experience the fragrance before choosing it in other formats.\n\nContents: approx. 10 g\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**White tea flower · Lily of the valley · Musk**\n\nA blend of flowers where **geranium and carnation** add character, joined by the delicacy of white tea flower and lily of the valley. Musk softens the whole and adds a clean, cosy base. A **floral, fresh and delicate** composition, reminiscent of a garden full of flowers.	Talabot Studio	1.65	\N	21.00	2.00	EUR	0	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Floral, fresc i delicat", "valueEn": "Floral, fresh and delicate", "valueEs": "Floral, fresco y delicado"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Flor de te blanc · Muguet · Almesc", "valueEn": "White tea flower · Lily of the valley · Musk", "valueEs": "Flor de té blanco · Muguet · Musk"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "1 Discovery Cube", "valueEn": "1 discovery cube", "valueEs": "1 Discovery Cube"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": 