tly wild character.\n\n**Last unit of the summer collection. It will not be restocked.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Sea salt · Sage · Driftwood**\n\nSea salt brings a fresh, mineral opening, joined by the aromatic character of sage and a driftwood base that adds depth. A marine, fresh and woody composition, inspired by the feeling of the air by the sea.	Talabot Studio	3.31	\N	21.00	4.00	EUR	0	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Marí, fresc i ambrat", "valueEn": "Marine, fresh and woody", "valueEs": "Marino, fresco y amaderado"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Sal marina · Sàlvia · Fusta flotant", "valueEn": "Sea salt · Sage · Driftwood", "valueEs": "Sal marina · Salvia · Madera flotante"}, {"keyCa": "Tipus", "keyEn": "Type", "keyEs": "Tipo", "valueCa": "Espelma aromàtica", "valueEn": "Scented candle", "valueEs": "Vela aromática"}, {"keyCa": "Tipus d'espelma", "keyEn": "Candle type", "keyEs": "Tipo de vela", "valueCa": "Espelma en recipient", "valueEn": "Container candle", "valueEs": "Vela en recipiente"}, {"keyCa": "Nivell de fragància", "keyEn": "Fragrance level", "keyEs": "Nivel de fragancia", "valueCa": "Perfumada", "valueEn": "Scented", "valueEs": "Perfumada"}, {"keyCa": "Material del recipient", "keyEn": "Container material", "keyEs": "Material del recipiente", "valueCa": "Alumini", "valueEn": "Aluminium", "valueEs": "Aluminio"}, {"keyCa": "Disponibilitat", "keyEn": "Availability", "keyEs": "Disponibilidad", "valueCa": "Última unitat", "valueEn": "Last unit", "valueEs": "Última unidad"}]	0	0	2026-10-19 00:09:02.128	2026-10-18 22:12:25.392	10	20	70	15	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-10-18 22:12:25.391	f	\N	\N	0	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	Carrer de València 190, 08011 Barcelona, España · info@talabotstudio.com	Talabot Studio	En el primer encendido, deja que la cera se funda de manera uniforme hasta alcanzar los bordes del recipiente.\n\nA partir del seg