Discover Vespertine before choosing your favourite format, or add it to a personalised gift as a small scented extra.**\n\nA small format made to try the fragrance at home and see how it fits your space.\n\nVespertine is a **floral, dark and sophisticated** fragrance, where black orchid combines with Balkan lily to create an intense, elegant and enveloping composition.\n\nUse the Discovery Cube in a wax melt burner to experience the fragrance before choosing it in other formats.\n\n**Contents: approx. 10 g**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Black orchid · Balkan lily**\n\nBlack orchid brings **depth and floral intensity**, while Balkan lily adds an elegant, enveloping character. A **floral, dark and sophisticated** composition with an intense, magnetic presence.	Talabot Studio	1.65	\N	21.00	2.00	EUR	0	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Floral, fosc i sofisticat", "valueEn": "Floral, dark and sophisticated", "valueEs": "Floral, oscuro y sofisticado"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Orquídia negra · Lliri balcànic · Bergamota", "valueEn": "Black orchid · Balkan lily", "valueEs": "Orquídea negra · Lirio balcánico"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "1 Discovery Cube", "valueEn": "1 discovery cube", "valueEs": "1 Discovery Cube"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "10 g aprox.", "valueEn": "10 g approx.", "valueEs": "10 g aprox."}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "3 × 3 × 1,5 cm", "valueEn": "3 × 3 × 1.5 cm", "valueEs": "3 × 3 × 1,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Ús", "keyEn": "Use", "keyEs": "Uso", "valueCa": "Per a cremadors de wax melts", "valueEn": "For wax melt burners", "valueEs": "Para quemador de wax melt