 tree, a quiet afternoon and that feeling of being at home.**\n\nThe scent of **ripe fig** combines with the character of cedar and the warm softness of sandalwood. A fruity, woody, warm and enveloping fragrance that evokes the calm of familiar places and the memories that stay.\n\nAvailable in two sizes: **100 g** with a **Stabilo** wick and **225 g** with a **wooden** wick.\n\nAlso available as a **Tin Pack, Wax Melt** and **Discovery Cube.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Ripe fig · Cedar · Sandalwood**\n\nRipe fig brings a **fruity, soft and slightly sweet** character, balanced by the depth of cedar and the creamy warmth of sandalwood. A **warm, enveloping** composition, where fruit and woods blend naturally.	Talabot Studio	8.68	\N	21.00	10.50	EUR	20	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Afruitat, càlid i afustat", "valueEn": "Fruity, warm and woody", "valueEs": "Afrutado, cálido y amaderado"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Figa madura · Cedre · Sàndal", "valueEn": "Ripe fig · Cedar · Sandalwood", "valueEs": "Higo maduro · Cedro · Sándalo"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Vidre ambre amb tapa daurada", "valueEn": "Amber glass with gold lid", "valueEs": "Vidrio ámbar con tapa dorada"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "Ø 5 × 6 cm (100 g) · Ø 7 × 9 cm (225 g)", "valueEn": "Ø 5 × 6 cm (100 g) · Ø 7 × 9 cm (225 g)", "valueEs": "Ø 5 × 6 cm (100 g) · Ø 7 × 9 cm (225 g)"}, {"keyCa": "Metxa", "keyEn": "Wick", "keyEs": "Mecha", "valueCa": "Stabilo (100 g) · Fusta (225 g)", "valueEn": "Stabilo (100 g) · Wood (225 g)", "valueEs": "Stabilo (100 g) · madera (225 g)"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboració