er flower and a soft fabric-softener accord.\n\nTo perfume the room and your fabrics, and bring back that unmistakable feeling of **freshly washed clothes**.\n\nAlso available as a **scented candle, Wax Melt, Discovery Cube** and **Arrels Tin Pack.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Cotton · Water flower · Fabric softener**\n\nCotton brings a soft, clean feel, joined by the light freshness of water flower. The fabric-softener accord leaves a cosy, familiar base reminiscent of freshly washed fabrics.	Talabot Studio	10.33	\N	21.00	12.50	EUR	6	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Net, fresc i reconfortant", "valueEn": "Clean, fresh and comforting", "valueEs": "Limpio, fresco y reconfortante"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Cotó · Flor d'aigua · Suavitzant", "valueEn": "Cotton · Water flower · Fabric softener", "valueEs": "Algodón · Flor de agua · Suavizante"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "100 ml", "valueEn": "100 ml", "valueEs": "100 ml"}, {"keyCa": "Format", "keyEn": "Format", "keyEs": "Formato", "valueCa": "Home Spray", "valueEn": "Home spray", "valueEs": "Home Spray"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Vidre amb polvoritzador", "valueEn": "Glass bottle with spray", "valueEs": "Vidrio con pulverizador"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "Ø 5,5 × 14 cm", "valueEn": "Ø 5.5 × 14 cm", "valueEs": "Ø 5,5 × 14 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Ús", "keyEn": "Use", "keyEs": "Uso", "valueCa": "Ambient i tèxtils", "valueEn": "Room and fabrics", "valueEs": "Ambiente y textiles"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Preparat a mà en petits lots a Barcelona", "valueEn": "Handmade in small batches in Barcelona", "valueEs": "Preparado a mano en pequeños lotes en Barcelona"}]	0	0	2026-10-19 00:09:00.