onto aparece un recuerdo, y con él una sensación tranquila, casi íntima. No pesa. Acompaña.\n\nEstá ligado a una forma de memoria que no intenta retener, sino aceptar que todo ha pasado… y que aun así sigue teniendo significado.\n\nNatsukashii no te lleva atrás. Trae el pasado hacia ti, por un momento.\n\nY en ese cruce silencioso, lo que fue… vuelve a sentirse cercano.\n\n**Características:**\n\n- Vela en envase de vidrio negro con tapa personalizada Komorebi artesanal.\n- 210 g de cera de soja sin parafinas.\n- Pabilo de algodón.\n- Esencias premium veganas, libres de ftalatos y parabenos, y certificadas por IFRA.\n- Opción con caja personalizada de la marca (ideal para regalar o regalarte).\n- Ideal para las y los amantes de la cultura japonesa.\n\n**Pirámide olfativa:**\n\n- **Notas altas:** lavanda, limón y bergamota.\n- **Notas medias:** manzanilla, haba tonka, lilas y pino.\n- **Notas de fondo:** azúcar, almizcle.	*Natsukashii…* the emotion of remembering with warmth.\n\nIn Japan it is not just nostalgia. It doesn't look back at the past with sadness, but with a gentle closeness, as if what was lived still had a place in the present.\n\nNatsukashii is that moment. It is not melancholy. It is not painful longing. It is recognition.\n\nThe smell of something familiar, a song, a street, an afternoon light… suddenly a memory appears, and with it a calm, almost intimate feeling. It doesn't weigh you down. It keeps you company.\n\nIt is tied to a kind of memory that doesn't try to hold on, but accepts that everything has passed… and still has meaning.\n\nNatsukashii doesn't take you back. It brings the past to you, for a moment.\n\nAnd in that silent crossing, what once was… feels close again.\n\n**Features:**\n\n- Candle in a black glass jar with a custom Komorebi artesanal lid.\n- 210 g of paraffin-free soy wax.\n- Cotton wick.\n- Vegan premium essences, free from phthalates and parabens, and IFRA-certified.\n- Option with the brand's custom gift box (ideal as a 