ridad y bienestar. Finalmente, el fondo de almizcle y delicadas notas amaderadas aporta calidez y permanencia, como esa paz interior que llega cuando aceptamos y dejamos fluir.\n\nPerfecto para ambientar las estancias del hogar.\n\nHecho con base vegetal y esencias libres de ftalatos y parabenos. Además, está libre de compuestos CMR (carcinógenos, mutágenos y tóxicos para la reproducción).\n\nCon una duración aproximada de 3-4 meses. Limpio y duradero. Envase minimalista de 200 ml, de color negro y boquilla dorada, con su *packaging*, una ramita de flores secas y 4 varillas.\n\nCada mikado está inspirado en una palabra o concepto japonés.	Meet Shikata Ga Nai, a 200 ml reed diffuser inspired by the Japanese philosophy meaning "it cannot be helped" or "accepting what is". An invitation to let go, breathe deeply and let calm flow through your home.\n\nFrom the very first moment, its ozonic notes evoke pure, renewed air, like a window opened after the rain. The soft, sweet touch of ylang-ylang brings balance and harmony, setting the scene for a serene experience.\n\nAt the heart, violet iris and lily of the valley fill the room with that comforting feeling of clean laundry, conveying order, clarity and well-being. Finally, the base of musk and delicate woody notes brings warmth and lasting power, like the inner peace that comes when we accept and let things flow.\n\nPerfect for scenting the rooms of your home.\n\nMade with a plant-based base and essences free from phthalates and parabens. It is also free from CMR compounds (carcinogenic, mutagenic or toxic to reproduction).\n\nLasts approximately 3-4 months. Clean and long-lasting. Minimalist 200 ml black bottle with a gold collar, in its packaging, with a sprig of dried flowers and 4 reeds.\n\nEach reed diffuser is inspired by a Japanese word or concept.	Komorebi artesanal	14.88	\N	21.00	18.00	EUR	1	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "200 ml", "valueEn": "200 ml", "v