agancia elegida.\n\n📦 **Presentación:** 75 g\n\nFragancia sin ftalatos, sin parabenos y libre de CMR. Con esencias certificadas por IFRA.	**Isla Mema wax melt** ✨\n\nIn a corner where the sea kisses the cliffs and dragons sleep on clouds of salt, Isla Mema is born. A fragrance forged for brave spirits, as if it had been lit in the village of *How to Train Your Dragon*.\n\nIts scent guides you like the wind over the ocean: sparkling bergamot, a sea-salt breeze, the delicacy of water lily and the ancient depth of oakmoss. A fresh, wild blend, gentle yet untamed.\n\n**Scent:** bergamot, sea salt, water lily and oakmoss.\n\nFragrance in solid form, to melt in a burner.\n\n- ✅ Ideal for scenting your home quickly and lastingly.\n- ✅ Place a piece in the burner, without water, and let the heat release its essence.\n- ✅ Perfect for creating cosy, relaxing or energising atmospheres depending on the fragrance you choose.\n\n📦 **Size:** 75 g\n\nFragrance free from phthalates, parabens and CMR substances. With IFRA-certified essences.	Komorebi artesanal	6.20	\N	21.00	7.50	EUR	5	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "75 g", "valueEn": "75 g", "valueEs": "75 g"}]	0	0	2026-10-19 17:00:32.175	2026-10-20 06:58:56.383	14	19	150	13	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-10-20 06:58:56.372	f	g	75.000	0	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	Avinguda California 121, 08811 Canyelles (Barcelona), España · komorebiartesanal@gmail.com	Komorebi artesanal (Júlia Poveda Aliaga)	Usa el wax melt solo en un quemador para wax melts: coloca un trozo en la parte superior, sin agua, y deja que el calor libere su esencia.\n\nNunca dejes la vela de té del quemador encendida sin supervisión.\n\nColoca el quemador en una superficie estable, lejos de corrientes de aire.\n\nMantenlo fuera del alcance de niños y mascotas.	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	t	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N	2	f	t	\N	\N	\N	200	t	0	f
