o:** 200 g de naturaleza y calma en estado puro.\n- **Envase:** Tarro de vidrio ámbar reutilizable que proyecta una luz íntima y de refugio.\n- **Mecha:** madera para escuchar el precioso crepitar.\n- **Ingredientes:** Formulada con esencias de alta calidad libres de CMR y tóxicos, garantizando un ambiente sano y seguro.\n- **Cera de soja** 100% ecológica, de proximidad y sin parafinas.	That baked treat that brightens up any grey afternoon. Notes of freshly made waffle, the honeyed texture of syrup and a creamy peanut base.\n\nInspired by the ritual of unhurried afternoon snacks when the cold starts to bite outside. Chapter II smells of a busy kitchen, of batter turning golden on the iron and of that sweet steam that makes you smile as soon as you walk in. It balances the toastiness of **warm waffle with the richness of maple syrup and an irresistible touch of peanut butter**. A **thoroughly gourmand fragrance**, deep and delicious, made to turn the afternoon into your favourite moment of the day.\n\n**Candle details:**\n\n- **Format:** 200 g of pure nature and calm.\n- **Jar:** Reusable amber glass jar that casts an intimate, sheltering light.\n- **Wick:** Wooden, so you can hear its lovely crackle.\n- **Ingredients:** Made with high-quality essences free from CMR substances and toxins, for a healthy, safe atmosphere.\n- **Soy wax:** 100% organic, locally sourced and paraffin-free.	Komorebi artesanal	12.81	\N	21.00	15.50	EUR	4	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "200 g", "valueEn": "200 g", "valueEs": "200 g"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja 100% ecològica", "valueEn": "100% organic soy", "valueEs": "Soja 100% ecológica"}, {"keyCa": "Metxa", "keyEn": "Wick", "keyEs": "Mecha", "valueCa": "Fusta", "valueEn": "Wood", "valueEs": "Madera"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Vidre ambre", "valueEn": "Amber glass", "valueEs": "Vidrio ámbar